==Description==
'''Small''' is a [[Modifiers|modifier]] which exclusively appears in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode. It makes enemies smaller, reduces their health and boosts their speed.

==Effects==
When activated, '''Small''' will make enemies twice as fast, reduces their health in half and make them be 50% of their regular size.

==Update History==
*'''16 December 2024''' - [[v1.46.0]]
**'''Small''' added, exclusively appearing in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.
**{{Bug}} Can cause enemies to have decimal health values.



